trait-schizophrenia-name = Schizophrenia
trait-schizophrenia-desc = You hear sounds and voices that are not there. Nobody else does.

hallucination-voice-1 = Someone is standing right behind you.
hallucination-voice-2 = They know what you did.
hallucination-voice-3 = Don't turn around.
hallucination-voice-4 = You are being watched.
hallucination-voice-5 = You were not supposed to hear that.
hallucination-voice-6 = Nobody here is who they say they are.
hallucination-voice-7 = The lights went out. Did you notice?
hallucination-voice-8 = Someone said your name.
hallucination-voice-9 = It moved when you looked away.
hallucination-voice-10 = You should not have come in here.
hallucination-voice-11 = They are talking about you on the radio.
hallucination-voice-12 = The door was locked a second ago.
hallucination-voice-13 = Something is wrong with the air.
hallucination-voice-14 = You are alone. You have always been alone.

